#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/cs.ex:30
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Manage channel registration and access lists through ChanServ.\nSubcommands: register, drop, info, archive on|off, language <code|none>, category <name|none>, sop/aop/vop add|del|list, help. Must be in a channel.\nAccess hierarchy: SOP (super-operator) > AOP (auto-operator) > VOP (auto-voice).\nRegister requires channel operator. Drop, archive, language and category require being the channel founder."
msgstr ""
"Gestiona el registro del canal y las listas de acceso a través de ChanServ.\n"
"Subcomandos: register, drop, info, archive on|off, language <code|none>, category <name|none>, sop/aop/vop add|del|list, help. Hay que estar en un canal.\n"
"Jerarquía de acceso: SOP (superoperador) > AOP (autooperador) > VOP (autovoz).\n"
"Register requiere ser operador del canal. Drop, archive, language y category requieren ser el fundador del canal."

